                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've been curious about this racing game after I got it from some random bundle many years ago. I finally decided to try it out... and it has no single player campaign - only a very limited Time Trial mode.\n\nThis game is intended to be played online with other human players... but there are always 0 players. Additionally, it seems the last update was in 2017, and the notes are literally \"Lorem ipsum\" filler text. And finally, the controls and all the team mechanics... they are a bit complicated for me.\n\nSo, I do think trying out this game would be ok if the concept of racing and doing \"team combos\" to stop the other team sounds interesting to you... but ONLY on the day the game goes Free To Play, and gets a few players in. Otherwise, as long as Team Racing League has any price over $0, [b]do NOT buy this dead game.[/b]",
